        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Use Uint8Array's toHex in crypto.subtle.digest examples]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41714</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41714"/>
        <updated>2025-10-27T23:02:46.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1365071?u=a28e0813dc14227725639ff1d19a94f36319e285&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">Simplify code example in <code class="notranslate">crypto.subtle.digest</code> docs by using the relatively new <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Uint8Array/toHex" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">toHex</code> method of <code class="notranslate">Uint8Array</code></a>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">Computing the hexadecimal representation of a hash digest is a common problem. The current code example is needlessly verbose, when there is a simpler version that uses <code class="notranslate">toHex</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<p dir="auto">This PR modifies the following docs:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/SubtleCrypto/digest#converting_a_digest_to_a_hex_string" rel="nofollow">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/SubtleCrypto/digest#converting_a_digest_to_a_hex_string</a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Crypto_API/Non-cryptographic_uses_of_subtle_crypto" rel="nofollow">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Crypto_API/Non-cryptographic_uses_of_subtle_crypto</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>



<ul dir="auto">
<li>The <code class="notranslate">toHex</code> documentation was added one year ago in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2593694035" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/36387" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/36387/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/36387">#36387</a></li>
</ul>
]]></content>
